~ cassie
if is_quest_done("help_cassie")
	=> cassie_ledger
if has_item("showcase_key")
	Cassie: You still have my key. The door is right there. Why are you still looking at me? [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_9dc164]
	=> END
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: You. You walked away from me. Everyone does. I keep a list. You are on it now. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_cdc942]
elif get_level_flag("showcase.met")
	Cassie: You came back. Are you real this time? Hold out your hand so I can check. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_74cd88]
else
	Cassie: Oh. Hi. Do not move. Please. When people move they leave, and when they leave I forget their faces. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_76e465]
	% Cassie: You have a face I could forget. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_dfac0a]
	% Cassie: I knew someone with your hands. Or I will. It is hard to tell the direction. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_54031a]
	% Cassie: You are the third one today. Or the first. I lose count when the light changes. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_c1b454]
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.met")
	## Flavor, no effect.
	- How long have you been here? [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_5dead3]
		Cassie: I counted days until they stopped changing. Now I count the people who leave. You would be number nine. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_ac8ec3]
	- Say nothing [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_0a4fe5]
		Cassie: Good. If you are quiet I can hear you breathing, and then I know you are still here. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_404675]
Cassie: There is a door behind me. I tried it until my hands stopped working. Will you? [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_1e3b6f]
- Help her [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_6d62a0]
	$> add_sanity(10)
	$> give_item("showcase_key")
	if get_quest_stage("help_cassie") == -1
		$> advance_quest("help_cassie")
	$> add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: Here. My key. The last one who held it went through and did not come back. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_e38f97]
	Cassie: You will come back. Right? [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_8a1f67]
	## No answer on purpose, she does not want one.
	Cassie: That was not a question I wanted answered. Take it. Please. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_2590bb]
- Ignore her [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_20dd41]
	$> add_sanity(-20)
	$> add_opinion("cassie", -1)
	Cassie: Fine. I will stand here. I have had a lot of practice. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_36990d]
=> END


~ cassie_ledger
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: The door is open. I am grateful. I am. I also remember you leaving. I see it every time I close my eyes. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_5a6c22]
else
	Cassie: You came back and opened it. I did not think anyone would. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_555dfa]
Cassie: I owe you {{get_favor("cassie")}}. I count it at night and during the day. Here they look the same. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_80d0bd]
- Hate. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /] [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_a8a1d0]
	if give_item("aspect_of_hate")
		$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
		Cassie: Take it. One hate. It whispers when I hold it. It says things about you. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_2158c2]
	else
		Cassie: Your hands are full. I will keep the favor with the rest of what I keep. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_e55483]
- What does the fairy want? One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /] [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_8dd459]
	$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
	$> set_fact("choice.cassie_told")
	Cassie: She waits at the gate and smiles while she takes. She took something from me once. I only know because there is a gap where it was. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_8def89]
- Talk to the fairy for me. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 and get_debt("fairy") >= 1 /] [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_357d49]
	$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
	$> add_debt("fairy", -1)
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Cassie: I talked to her and your debt is gone. She looked at me the whole time, and she is still looking. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_490ce4]
## Repeatable, the loaf never runs out.
- Take this bread. [if has_item("bread") /] [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_5002b1]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> add_favor("cassie", 1)
	$> add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: For me? I forgot what food tastes like. I forgot a lot of things. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_81c9f0]
	Cassie: [#sanity_glitch] I will not forget that you brought it. I will keep it where I keep the other things. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_bd4e46]
	Cassie: I owe you one more. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_f7373c]
- Leave [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_723850]
	Cassie: Okay. Go. I will be here. [ID:brdijciqw4uj4_c311ee]
=> END

